-- 3. Load — the span takes weight. The full ensemble, still lazy.
-- ~40 cycles (~104 s at 92 BPM).

d1 kickSoft
d2 brush
d3 ride
xfadeIn 4 16 compLoad
xfadeIn 5 24 colourLoad

